    "attack_one_hand",
    "pixel art game character sprite in LOW TOP-DOWN view: the camera is slightly above the character looking down at about 15 degrees, exactly like the input image. Keep this camera angle for the whole clip. The bald character is {facing}. Holding the small dagger in the right hand, the character swings it in one quick wide arc across the front of the body at waist height, then returns to exactly the starting pose. The character keeps facing the same direction; the head does not turn or tilt. Camera fixed, no zoom, no pan. Plain white background, character centered and same size. Clean pixel art, same colors, sharp frames, no motion blur, no slash trail, no effects.",
